<!doctype lake><title>Distributed Parallelism II</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><section class="lake-revised-section" id="ringattention"><h1 data-lake-id="bh5RG" id="bh5RG" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ufdda5075" id="ufdda5075">🦉</span><span data-lake-id="u645e495e" id="u645e495e"> 𝐑𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐖𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐜𝐤𝐰𝐢𝐬𝐞 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐬 𝐅𝐨𝐫 𝐍𝐞𝐚𝐫-𝐈𝐧𝐟𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐭𝐞 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐱𝐭</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u3657959f" id="u3657959f"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub622c25d" id="ub622c25d" style="color: #DF2A3F">鉴于长上下文建模的重要性，降低内存开销已成为日益受到关注的研究方向。其中一类研究基于如下观察：自注意力机制中的 Softmax 矩阵计算无需显式构建完整矩阵。这一发现推动自注意力与前馈网络分块计算方法的发展，且无需引入任何近似计算</span></strong></p><ul list="ue66d1d7f"><li fid="ud238fac1" data-lake-id="uda10e6c4" id="uda10e6c4"><span data-lake-id="u09839370" id="u09839370">尽管这些方法降低内存开销，但存储每一层的输出仍然是一项重大挑战。存储需求源于自注意力机制的固有特性，即序列中所有元素之间均存在交互。后续层的自注意力计算依赖于对前一层全部输出的访问。若不存储这些输出，则需要针对序列中的每个元素重新计算所有输出，导致计算开销呈三次方增长，从而使长序列处理在实际应用中难以实现</span></li><li fid="ud238fac1" data-lake-id="u31ee6656" id="u31ee6656"><span data-lake-id="ub038efb4" id="ub038efb4">为直观说明其内存需求，即使批大小为 1，对于一个隐藏维度仅为 1024 的小规模模型，处理 1 亿个 Token 仍需要超过 1000 GB 的内存。这一需求远超当前 GPU 和 TPU 的内存容量，而这些设备通常仅配备不足 100 GB 的高带宽内存</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u065a0121" id="u065a0121"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e9e5076" id="u2e9e5076">为解决上述挑战，提出一项关键观察：通过采用分块方式执行自注意力与前馈网络计算，可以沿序列维度将计算分布至多个设备，从而实现计算与通信的并行执行。这一观察源于分块注意力计算的一个重要性质，即注意力计算结果不受各块计算顺序的影响</span></strong></p><ul list="u8d7fb2d4"><li fid="u5048af4c" data-lake-id="u34acc3b3" id="u34acc3b3"><strong><span data-lake-id="u343f8168" id="u343f8168" style="color: #5C0036">将查询块对应的外层循环分配至不同主机，使每个设备负责本地输入块。在内层循环中，各设备固定本地查询块，遍历所需键值块并增量更新注意力结果；当前查询块的注意力计算完成后，再对其输出执行前馈网络计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud5197ee1" id="ud5197ee1">。各主机设备在逻辑上构成一个环形结构。在内层循环执行过程中，每个设备将当前用于分块计算的键值块发送一份副本至环中的下一个设备，同时接收来自前一个设备的键值块。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb80c459" id="ubb80c459" style="color: #5C0036">当分块注意力计算足以覆盖键值块传输时，计算与通信的重叠可以隐藏这部分通信开销</span></strong></li><li fid="u5048af4c" data-lake-id="u5156ff53" id="u5156ff53"><span data-lake-id="u2340fd12" id="u2340fd12">利用分块并行 Transformer 降低内存开销，并在通信可被计算覆盖的条件下，将训练与推理的上下文长度扩展至数千万个 Token。上下文长度可以随设备数量增长，实际规模仍受总算力、内存容量与通信带宽约束。由于该方法通过 Transformer 的分块计算，实现环形主机之间键值块通信与计算的重叠，将其命名为 RingAttention with Blockwise Transformers</span></li><li fid="u5048af4c" data-lake-id="u4fc9525f" id="u4fc9525f"><span data-lake-id="u44eb9d72" id="u44eb9d72">RingAttention 能够降低 Transformer 的内存需求，并且能够在不对注意力机制进行任何近似的情况下，支持长度超过 1 亿 Token 的序列训练。尤为重要的是，RingAttention 消除单个设备所施加的内存容量限制，使训练与推理所支持的序列长度能够随设备数量成比例增长，从而实现近乎无限的上下文长度</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="ek2DU" id="ek2DU" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u5518cb3f" id="u5518cb3f">🦋</span><span data-lake-id="u60f931f3" id="u60f931f3"> 𝐋𝐚𝐫𝐠𝐞 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐱𝐭 𝐌𝐞𝐦𝐨𝐫𝐲 𝐂𝐨𝐧𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐭</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0ea5ffcb" id="u0ea5ffcb"><span data-lake-id="uefae0190" id="uefae0190">给定输入序列</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22Q%2C%20K%2C%20V%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bs%20%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5fb207be4da72dcf32e8a2f18381b7f7.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SR41l%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucdf58273" id="ucdf58273">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R0LDU%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2cfaf674" id="u2cfaf674">表示序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22d%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F56c1b0cb7a48ccf9520b0adb3c8cb2e8.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22z7iBW%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6bc2fa60" id="u6bc2fa60">表示注意力头的维度。输出矩阵的计算过程如下</span></p><p data-lake-id="u10161907" id="u10161907" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BAttention%7D(Q%2CK%2CV)%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7BQK%5E%7BT%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)V%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4f680557ab122727831e613a2f648ce5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JEhN5%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u14ba9353" id="u14ba9353"><span data-lake-id="uae414392" id="uae414392">其中，Softmax 沿矩阵的行维度执行。每个自注意力子层均配备一个前馈网络，该网络以相同的方式独立作用于序列中的每个位置。前馈网络由两次线性变换及其间的 ReLU 激活函数组成</span></p><p data-lake-id="u80d00ae2" id="u80d00ae2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BFFN%7D(x)%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmax(0%2CxW_1%2Bb_1)W_2%2Bb_2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fabac0b228a056e377e593e525351ae4d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CE9ko%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc34e9267" id="uc34e9267"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a28cc9b" id="u6a28cc9b">分块并行 Transformer：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ube0ca7b8" id="ube0ca7b8">现有先进方法通过采用分块计算策略，在无需显式构建完整注意力矩阵的情况下完成注意力计算，从而显著降低内存开销。这些研究进展将每层注意力机制的内存开销降低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222bsh%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F641f3182690133817b0922e94db3e3a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lQUQf%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2d59bc66" id="u2d59bc66">字节，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22b%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd29c2e5f4926e5b0e9a95305650f6e54.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22r8QBV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0b19e33c" id="u0b19e33c">表示批大小，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F79ce3c7a71877c2ff01695e38ade43ca.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SflSM%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64a0b24e" id="u64a0b24e">表示序列长度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22h%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F67df0f404d0960fadcc99f6258733f22.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PLrro%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uec0fa09f" id="uec0fa09f">表示模型的隐藏维度。为进一步降低内存开销，分块并行 Transformer（Blockwise Parallel Transformer，BPT）提出一种针对每个自注意力子层所对应的前馈网络进行分块计算的策略。该方法有效地将前馈网络的最大激活大小从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%228bsh%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F51558b4df6a335184376066f8b7e1446.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vPg0W%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u133037d3" id="u133037d3">降低至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%222bsh%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F641f3182690133817b0922e94db3e3a1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ibWqS%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uba68ef7e" id="uba68ef7e"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2659201" id="ue2659201">各层输出的存储开销：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u338fe4b5" id="u338fe4b5">尽管 BPT 显著降低 Transformer 的内存需求，但由于仍需存储每一层的输出，上下文长度的进一步扩展依然面临重大挑战。这一存储需求源于自注意力机制的固有特性，即序列中所有元素之间均存在交互。若不存储这些输出，后续层的自注意力计算便需要针对序列中的每个元素重新计算相关输出，从而使计算开销高到难以实际应用的程度</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="fcOq3" id="fcOq3" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u54d74930" id="u54d74930">🐝 𝐑𝐢𝐧𝐠𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧 𝐖𝐢𝐭𝐡 𝐁𝐥𝐨𝐜𝐤𝐰𝐢𝐬𝐞 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐧𝐬𝐟𝐨𝐫𝐦𝐞𝐫𝐬</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u9a216026" id="u9a216026"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0914f3ab" id="u0914f3ab">主要目标是在不引入额外开销的前提下，将长序列高效地分布至多个主机，从而消除单设备所施加的内存约束</span></strong></p><ul list="u48524e4d"><li fid="uc1620345" data-lake-id="u5d523d68" id="u5d523d68"><span data-lake-id="ua20a4de2" id="ua20a4de2">当输入序列沿序列维度分布至不同主机时，每个主机持有对应的输入块，并负责本地查询块的外层迭代。内层循环固定本地查询块，依次接收环上传递的键值块，逐块计算注意力并更新在线 Softmax 的统计量与输出；遍历所需键值块后，合并结果与完整序列上的标准注意力一致。本地查询块的注意力结果完整之后，才执行对应的前馈网络。仅考虑序列维度切分时，前馈网络独立作用于每个位置，因此可以直接处理本地输出，无需传输远端 token 的激活</span></li><li fid="uc1620345" data-lake-id="u9c7eae7d" id="u9c7eae7d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u84ecfc95" id="u84ecfc95" style="color: #DF2A3F">内层循环涉及键值块之间的交互，需要从其他主机获取相应的数据块。由于每个主机仅持有一个键值块，直接从其他主机获取键值块的朴素方法会引发两个显著问题。首先，系统需要等待所需键值块的到达，从而产生计算延迟。其次，键值块的累积会增加内存占用，违背降低内存开销的初衷</span></strong></li></ul><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A1024%2C%22height%22%3A291.83%2C%22originWidth%22%3A3737%2C%22originHeight%22%3A1065%2C%22title%22%3A%22RingAttention%20%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%84%E4%B8%8E%E5%88%86%E5%9D%97%E8%B0%83%E5%BA%A6%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22ringattention-figure%22%7D" data-asset="assets/da5f8278fe663748fcfb8dc86124b021.png"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2b6cea62" id="u2b6cea62"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3b38b5c" id="uc3b38b5c">基于环形拓扑的分块 Transformer：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4efd8ed9" id="u4efd8ed9">为解决上述问题，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u79a3e159" id="u79a3e159" style="color: #270070">利用内层循环中键值块计算的排列不变性。这一性质源于以下事实：只要能够正确合并各数据块的统计量以进行重新缩放，查询块与一组键值块之间的自注意力计算便可以按照任意顺序执行</span></strong></p><ul list="uf59aa1cd"><li fid="ufb362c79" data-lake-id="ueee4635b" id="ueee4635b"><span data-lake-id="ua4b9d20d" id="ua4b9d20d">基于这一性质，逻辑上将所有主机构建为一个环形结构：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bhost%7D_1%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bhost%7D_2%2C%20%5C%5Cldots%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bhost%7D_N%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53769f84e17d6c57ab206c79cc5f8901.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JO1Fi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8d5d9850" id="u8d5d9850">。在内层循环执行分块注意力计算时，每个主机将当前键值块发送至环中的下一个主机，同时接收来自前一个主机的键值块，从而将键值块传输与当前注意力块的计算重叠。前馈网络不随每一轮键值块传输重复执行</span></li><li fid="ufb362c79" data-lake-id="u35354506" id="u35354506"><span data-lake-id="uc9de0f5f" id="uc9de0f5f">具体而言，对于任意主机</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bhost%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdf1c2537aefdae698dc279c69318998d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rMuu3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u06f2ddc3" id="u06f2ddc3">，在计算其查询块与当前键值块之间的注意力时，该主机同时将键值块发送至下一个主机</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bhost%7D_%7Bi%2B1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8a0eb528bb0c1d032326c9fa130c403b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22R9Zr7%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u98002dd4" id="u98002dd4">，并接收来自前一个主机</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7Bhost%7D_%7Bi-1%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3658e91289efdd20ebb11822f36e9a75.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xkEzR%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue030cfcb" id="ue030cfcb"> 的键值块。若注意力块的计算足以覆盖键值块传输，且二者能够实际并行，则可以隐藏这部分通信耗时。由于前向传播与反向传播均可采用相同的操作与技术，因此上述计算与通信重叠机制同时适用于本文方法的前向传播和反向传播</span></li></ul><figure class="paper-algorithm" aria-labelledby="ringattention-algorithm"><figcaption id="ringattention-algorithm"><strong>Algorithm 1</strong> Large Context Transformers using RingAttention with Blockwise Transformers.</figcaption><p style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ringattention-algorithm-math%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Bl%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7BRequired%3A%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7BInput%20sequence%20%7Dx.%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctext%7BNumber%20of%20hosts%20%7DN_h.%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BInitialize%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BSplit%20input%20sequence%20into%20%7DN_h%5C%5Ctext%7B%20blocks%20that%20each%20host%20has%20one%20input%20block.%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BCompute%20query%2C%20key%2C%20and%20value%20for%20its%20input%20block%20on%20each%20host.%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7BEach%20transformer%20layer%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7Dcount%3D1%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bto%20%7DN_h-1%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7BFor%20each%20host%20concurrently.%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BCompute%20memory%20efficient%20attention%20incrementally%20using%20local%20query%2C%20key%2C%20value%20blocks.%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctext%7BSend%20key%20and%20value%20blocks%20to%20next%20host%20and%20receive%20key%20and%20value%20blocks%20from%20previous%20host.%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bfor%20%7D%5C%5Ctext%7BFor%20each%20host%20concurrently.%20%7D%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bdo%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7BCompute%20memory%20efficient%20feedforward%20using%20local%20attention%20output.%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cquad%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B3pt%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctextbf%7Bend%20for%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%22%7D"></card></p></figure><h2 data-lake-id="ring-inference-requirement" id="ring-inference-requirement" style="text-align: center"><span>🐿️ Inference requirement</span></h2><p><span>前向传播：固定本地查询块，让键值块沿环流转，并通过在线 Softmax 逐块合并注意力结果，从而无需汇集完整的键值序列，也能得到精确的注意力输出</span></p><card type="block" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ring-attention-forward%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20_ring_attention_fwd%28q%2C%20k%2C%20v%2C%20attn_bias%2C%20axis_name%2C%20float32_logits%2C%20blockwise_kwargs%29%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20float32_logits%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q%2C%20k%20%3D%20q.astype%28jnp.float32%29%2C%20k.astype%28jnp.float32%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20batch%2C%20q_len%2C%20num_heads%2C%20dim_per_head%20%3D%20q.shape%5Cn%20%20%20%20batch%2C%20kv_len%2C%20num_heads%2C%20dim_per_head%20%3D%20k.shape%5Cn%20%20%20%20numerator%20%3D%20jnp.zeros%28%28batch%2C%20q_len%2C%20num_heads%2C%20dim_per_head%29%29.astype%28q.dtype%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20denominator%20%3D%20jnp.zeros%28%28batch%2C%20num_heads%2C%20q_len%29%29.astype%28q.dtype%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20axis_size%20%3D%20lax.psum%281%2C%20axis_name%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20block_size%20%3D%20q_len%20%23%20assumes%20this%20function%20is%20pre-sharded%20inside%20shard_map%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_chunk_size%20%3D%20blockwise_kwargs%5B%5C%22query_chunk_size%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20key_chunk_size%20%3D%20blockwise_kwargs%5B%5C%22key_chunk_size%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20scan_kv_block%28carry%2C%20idx%29%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20prev_max_score%2C%20numerator%2C%20denominator%2C%20k%2C%20v%20%3D%20carry%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20attn_bias_slice%20%3D%20lax.dynamic_slice_in_dim%28attn_bias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%28lax.axis_index%28axis_name%29%20-%20idx%29%20%25%20axis_size%20%2A%20kv_len%2C%20kv_len%2C%20axis%3D-1%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q_block_idx%20%3D%20lax.axis_index%28axis_name%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k_block_idx%20%3D%20%28lax.axis_index%28axis_name%29%20-%20idx%29%20%25%20axis_size%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20q_chunk_idx_start%20%3D%20q_block_idx%20%2A%20%28block_size%20%2F%2F%20query_chunk_size%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k_chunk_idx_start%20%3D%20k_block_idx%20%2A%20%28block_size%20%2F%2F%20key_chunk_size%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20numerator%2C%20denominator%2C%20max_score%20%3D%20_blockwise_attention_fwd%28q%2C%20k%2C%20v%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%28numerator%2C%20denominator%2C%20prev_max_score%29%2C%20q_chunk_idx_start%2C%20k_chunk_idx_start%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20bias%3Dattn_bias_slice%2C%20%2A%2Ablockwise_kwargs%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20k%2C%20v%20%3D%20map%28lambda%20x%3A%20lax.ppermute%28x%2C%20axis_name%2C%20perm%3D%5B%28i%2C%20%28i%20%2B%201%29%20%25%20axis_size%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20for%20i%20in%20range%28axis_size%29%5D%29%2C%20%28k%2C%20v%29%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20%28max_score%2C%20numerator%2C%20denominator%2C%20k%2C%20v%29%2C%20None%5Cn%20%20%20%20prev_max_score%20%3D%20jnp.full%28%28batch%2C%20num_heads%2C%20q_len%29%2C%20-jnp.inf%29.astype%28q.dtype%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20%28max_score%2C%20numerator%2C%20denominator%2C%20_%2C%20_%29%2C%20_%20%3D%20lax.scan%28scan_kv_block%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20init%3D%28prev_max_score%2C%20numerator%2C%20denominator%2C%20k%2C%20v%29%2C%20xs%3Djnp.arange%280%2C%20axis_size%29%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20output%20%3D%20numerator%20%2F%20rearrange%28denominator%2C%20%27b%20h%20q%20-%3E%20b%20q%20h%27%29%5B...%2C%20None%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20output.astype%28v.dtype%29%2C%20%28output%2C%20q%2C%20k%2C%20v%2C%20attn_bias%2C%20denominator%2C%20max_score%29%5Cn%22%2C%22language%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22caption%22%3A%22RingAttention%20Forward%22%7D"></card><p><span>反向传播：利用前向保存的统计量逐块计算梯度，查询梯度留在本地累积，键和值梯度随对应数据块沿环传递并汇总，避免集中存储完整序列的梯度</span></p><card type="block" name="codeblock" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ring-attention-backward%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20_ring_attention_bwd%28axis_name%2C%20float32_logits%2C%20blockwise_kwargs%2C%20res%2C%20g%29%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20output%2C%20q%2C%20k%2C%20v%2C%20attn_bias%2C%20denominator%2C%20max_score%20%3D%20res%5Cn%20%20%20%20batch%2C%20kv_len%2C%20num_heads%2C%20dim_per_head%20%3D%20k.shape%5Cn%20%20%20%20axis_size%20%3D%20lax.psum%281%2C%20axis_name%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20dq%20%3D%20jnp.zeros_like%28q%2C%20dtype%3Djnp.float32%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20dk%20%3D%20jnp.zeros_like%28k%2C%20dtype%3Djnp.float32%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20dv%20%3D%20jnp.zeros_like%28v%2C%20dtype%3Djnp.float32%29%5Cn%20%20%20%20query_chunk_size%20%3D%20blockwise_kwargs%5B%5C%22query_chunk_size%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20key_chunk_size%20%3D%20blockwise_kwargs%5B%5C%22key_chunk_size%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20block_size%20%3D%20q.shape%5B1%5D%20%23%20assumes%20this%20function%20is%20pre-sharded%20inside%20shard_map%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20scan_kv_block%28carry%2C%20idx%29%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20dq%2C%20dk%2C%20dv%2C%20k%2C%20v%20%3D%20carry%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20attn_bias_slice%20%3D%20lax.dynamic_slice_in_dim%28attn_bias%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%28lax.axis_index%28axis_name%29%20-%20idx%29%20%25%20axis_size%20%2A%20kv_len%2C%20kv_len%2